[00:00.00]Namaste Sada Vatsale Matribhume
[00:15.00]
[00:16.50]Namaste sada vatsale matribhume
[00:27.00]Tvaya hindu bhume sukham vardhito’ham
[00:37.50]Mahanmangale punyabhume tvadarthe
[00:48.00]Patatvesha kayo namaste namaste || 1 ||
[00:59.00]
[01:00.00]Prabho shaktiman hindu rashtranga bhuta
[01:10.50]Ime tsatvayam sadaram namatamo
[01:21.00]Tvadiyaya karyaya baddha kativyam
[01:31.50]Shubhamashisham dehi tasmadhvishaya || 2 ||
[01:42.50]
[01:43.50]Ajayan cha vishwasya dehyisha shaktim
[01:54.00]Sushilam jagad yena namram bhavet
[02:04.50]Shrutan chaiva yat kantakakirna margam
[02:15.00]Swayam swikritam nah sugamankaryat || 3 ||
[02:26.00]
[02:27.00]Samutkarsha nishreyasasyaika magram
[02:37.50]Param sadhanam nama viravratam
[02:48.00]Tadantah sphuratvakhya tivra nisham
[02:58.50]Prabho vira vritti dhridham dehi nah || 4 ||
[03:09.50]
[03:10.50]Vigrihya sphuratyasmat kalyanpanthah
[03:21.00]Samrudhyatvayam hi tvatvishwarashtram
